comment on table public.casual_meal_signups is
  'TAM THOI - suat an vang lai cho khach dang ky Giai doan 1 trong dot khuyen mai cua quan. Dong bo mot chieu tu tab "Khach An" (Google Sheet) qua KhachVangLai.gs. KHONG check trung nguoi dang ky (theo yeu cau cua quy) -- 1 nguoi dang ky nhieu lan duoc tinh nhieu suat. signup_key = so dien thoai + thoi gian dang ky, chi dung de tranh dong bo lap lai cung 1 dong khi quet sheet nhieu lan, khong phai de chong trung nguoi. Duoc doc boi app/api/casual/route.ts (tab Theo doi 24h) VA app/api/report/route.ts (gop vao bao cao xuat theo ngay). Xoa bang nay + file KhachVangLai.gs (va trigger cua no) + 2 route tren khi dot khuyen mai ket thuc.';
